{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:51f185b785dd1bd5","name":"Lightsaber Pike","source":{"id":"source:reference-51f185b785dd1bd5","title":"Lightsaber Pike","revision":20474,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:55:16Z","sha256":"a62c3998f6c02a359f01279e371274ec7b2292ccf541c7fae9747190378aa6cf","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20474","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lightsaber%20Pike&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-51f185b785dd1bd5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The favored weapon of the Emperor's Shadow Guard, the Lightsaber Pike resembles a conventional polearm in many respects. The long haft of the weapon is made of Phrik alloy, meaning that a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," does not ignore the Lightsaber Pike's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At the end of the handle is a slightly shorter and thicker Lightsaber blade, which can be activated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," using a switch about midway down the weapon's haft. A Lightsaber Pike increases the wielder's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"}," by 1 square, but imposes a -2 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks to use the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]}," or ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," talents.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A character with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Long Haft Strike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Long_Haft_Strike","referenceId":"reference:8fe2e29392349f17"}," feat can use the Lightsaber Pike as a Double Weapon. If you have this feat, you can attack with both ends of a Lightsaber Pike as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", but both attack rolls take a -10 penalty; certain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," can reduce these penalties. The non-Lightsaber end of the Lightsaber Pike deals 1d6 damage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Lightsaber Pike requires a special ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," to operate (the cost is ten times the price of an ordinary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"},", but it lasts almost indefinitely).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 4,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy and Slashing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
